<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_III__cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_III__cl_12> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
