<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "dia mempunyai kontrak kerja dengan perkhidmatan awam."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Suatu permohonan oleh bukan warganegara Malaysia untuk beramal hendaklah mengikut cara yang ditentukan oleh Majlis dan permohonan itu hendaklah disertakan dengan fi yang ditetapkan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Jika Majlis meluluskan permohonan di bawah subseksyen (2), Pendaftar hendaklah mengeluarkan kepada bukan warganegara Malaysia itu suatu perakuan amalan sementara dan membuat catatan dalam Daftar."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Tiada seorang pun bukan warganegara Malaysia boleh mengamalkan mana-mana Profesion Kesihatan Bersekutu melainkan jika dia telah diberikan perakuan amalan sementara."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Perakuan amalan sementara adalah sah bagi tempoh satu tahun dari tarikh perakuan itu dikeluarkan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Majlis boleh membatalkan perakuan amalan sementara jika pemegang perakuan itu gagal mematuhi syarat dan sekatan yang dinyatakan dalam perakuan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Perakuan amalan sementara boleh diperbaharui melalui permohonan kepada Majlis dan disertakan dengan fi yang ditetapkan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Perakuan amalan sementara hendaklah menyatakan alamat tempat amalan utama dan semua tempat amalan lain pemegang perakuan amalan sementara dan apa-apa perubahan kepada mana-mana alamat hendaklah diberitahu oleh pemegang perakuan amalan sementara dalam tempoh tiga puluh hari dari tarikh perubahan itu kepada Pendaftar dan Pendaftar hendaklah mengendors perubahan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/24/msa@> .
